※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4551

※ A capture list names what the body may reach from around it, so every name
※ in it is one the place the lambda is written can see.  A name that is not is
※ a spelling, or a name that belongs somewhere else.

@[startup, impure]
fn main() → u6:
    let f: fn(u8) → u8 = λ a: u8 [nope] → u8 { a }
    0u6
